{"step_index":372,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:42:05Z","content":"Key findings:\n- `which org xinit startx vesa` → `/usr/local/bin/startx` exists ✅\n- No Xorg log at `/var/log/Xorg.0.log` — Xorg never actually launched\n- `bootlocal.sh` runs as root but `su - tc` may fail in this environment\n\nThe fix: run `xinit` directly as root (not via `su - tc`), and use `Xorg -configure` fallback. Let me fix bootlocal and rebuild:","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Run startx directly as root without su, and add HOME/DISPLAY env vars so X can find config\"","EndLine":"295","Instruction":"\"Fix xinit to run as root directly without su\"","ReplacementContent":"\"bootlocal_sh = \\\"\\\"\\\"#!/bin/sh\\nmkdir -p /lib64\\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\nexport PORT=8080\\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\\n\\nmkdir -p /etc/X11\\ncat > /etc/X11/xorg.conf << 'XEOF'\\nSection \\\"Device\\\"\\n  Identifier \\\"Card0\\\"\\n  Driver \\\"vesa\\\"\\nEndSection\\nSection \\\"Screen\\\"\\n  Identifier \\\"Screen0\\\"\\n  Device \\\"Card0\\\"\\n  DefaultDepth 16\\nEndSection\\nSection \\\"ServerFlags\\\"\\n  Option \\\"AllowMouseOpenFail\\\" \\\"true\\\"\\n  Option \\\"AutoAddDevices\\\" \\\"false\\\"\\nEndSection\\nXEOF\\n\\nmkdir -p /home/tc\\ncat > /home/tc/.xinitrc << 'XIEOF'\\n#!/bin/sh\\nxsetroot -solid '#1a1a2e'\\ndillo http://127.0.0.1:8080/ &\\nexec jwm\\nXIEOF\\nchmod +x /home/tc/.xinitrc\\nchown -R tc:staff /home/tc 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\nsleep 2\\nexport HOME=/home/tc\\nexport DISPLAY=:0\\nexport XAUTHORITY=/home/tc/.Xauthority\\nxinit /home/tc/.xinitrc -- :0 -ac vt7 > /tmp/xinit.log 2>&1 &\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nadd_text('opt/bootlocal.sh', bootlocal_sh, 0o100755)\"","StartLine":"267","TargetContent":"\"bootlocal_sh = \\\"\\\"\\\"#!/bin/sh\\nmkdir -p /lib64\\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\nexport PORT=8080\\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\\n\\n# Write Xorg config for VESA (works in QEMU/VirtualBox)\\nmkdir -p /etc/X11\\ncat > /etc/X11/xorg.conf << 'XEOF'\\nSection \\\"Device\\\"\\n  Identifier \\\"Card0\\\"\\n  Driver \\\"vesa\\\"\\nEndSection\\nSection \\\"Screen\\\"\\n  Identifier \\\"Screen0\\\"\\n  Device \\\"Card0\\\"\\n  DefaultDepth 16\\nEndSection\\nSection \\\"ServerFlags\\\"\\n  Option \\\"AllowMouseOpenFail\\\" \\\"true\\\"\\n  Option \\\"AutoAddDevices\\\" \\\"false\\\"\\nEndSection\\nXEOF\\n\\nmkdir -p /home/tc\\ncat > /home/tc/.xinitrc << 'XIEOF'\\n#!/bin/sh\\nxsetroot -solid '#1a1a2e'\\ndillo http://127.0.0.1:8080/ &\\nexec jwm\\nXIEOF\\nchmod +x /home/tc/.xinitrc\\nchown -R tc:staff /home/tc 2>/dev/null || true\\n\\nsleep 2\\nsu - tc -c 'xinit /home/tc/.xinitrc -- :0 -ac vt7 2>/tmp/x.log' &\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nadd_text('opt/bootlocal.sh', bootlocal_sh, 0o100755)\"","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Bullettemporary\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\dump-garbage\\\\iso-builder\\\\build_real_iso.py\"","toolAction":"\"Fixing xinit to run as root\"","toolSummary":"\"Fix xinit root execution\""}}]}
