scripts, memory, and artifacts to dump-garbage repository.')\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Bullettemporary\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\dump-garbage\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Archiving chat history and artifacts to repo\"","toolSummary":"\"Archive artifacts to repo\""}}]}
